OL,3,GNEWSA'It will live with me for the rest
OL,4,Aof my life' - Veterans pay respects at
OL,5,AField of Remembrance
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt 102, John Eskdale is one of the few
OL,8,Fsurviving veterans of World War Two.
OL,10,FHe spent hours in freezing water
OL,11,Fcovered in oil when his ship was sunk
OL,12,Fby a German torpedo boat in 1943 - more
OL,13,Fthan 400 people died.
OL,15,FEskdale attended The Royal British
OL,16,FLegion's annual Field of Remembrance at
OL,17,FCardiff Castle on Wednesday, alongside
OL,18,Ffellow veterans, to pay his respects to
OL,19,Fthose who lost their lives that night.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
