OL,3,GNEWSA'It will live with me for the rest
OL,4,Aof my life' - Veterans pay respects at
OL,5,AField of Remembrance
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Field of Remembrance honours
OL,8,Fveterans serving in conflicts including
OL,9,Fboth World Wars, Korea, the Falklands,
OL,10,Fthe Gulf War, Iraq and Afghanistan.
